"""Append the independently verified source-selection guide without altering source artifacts."""
from pathlib import Path
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2];p=R/'assets/art-library/CARGO_COLLECTION.md';heading='## Selecting the editable source geometry'
if heading not in p.read_text():
 p.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\n## Selecting the editable source geometry\n\nThe [independent source inventory](cargo-collection/reviews/current_hidden_sources.json) lists exact current collection/object names and source hashes for the main19 designs. Eighteen sources retain hidden review helpers from earlier jobs under separate prior-design root collections. They are hidden in viewport and render and excluded from the visual GLB. Select the root matching the scene’s `design_id`: its `GEO` child contains the current editable geometry, and its `COLLISION` child contains the correct current occupancy proxy and packing gauge (the two fluid vessels omit the rectangular packing gauge). Do not combine old helper collections with the current design. All19 current proxy/gauge dimensions were independently checked against the specification.\n\nSeven r003 sources retain an `r002` suffix in the Blender collection label. Exact revision identity comes from the design ledger, scene revision, manifest path and source hash. The reviewers found no remaining physical ambiguity or blocker; a later helper purge would be a separately preserved source revision.\n'''.replace('main19','main 19').replace('All19','All 19'))
